      "airDate": "2011-09-19",
      "episodeCount": 175,
      "name": "Season 3",
      "overview": "The third season raises the bar with an array of new and exciting games, adding more high-value bargaining into the mix of the show. Host Wayne Brady will tempt contestants to increase the stakes during each of their trades and give audience members a chance to win big-ticket trips to exotic destinations such as Argentina, Australia and a luxurious railway trip across Canada. Brady's comedy and improvisational act will include a new sidekick, keyboardist extraordinaire Cat Gray.",
